{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_62f7a22dfc1d6f6e-1007\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>周嘉洛與朱敏瀚（朱仔）以及高海寧（高Ling）近日一同飛到韓國首爾，拍攝全新旅遊節目《Grand住去首爾》！連日來三人在首爾街頭頻頻被網民幸運「野生捕獲」，一舉一動均成為焦點、備受關注！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_62f7a22dfc1d6f6e-1008\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>面對粉絲們熱情的合照要求，三人絕對是來者不拒，展現超高親和力！有幸運網民在社交平台分享與周嘉洛及朱敏瀚的「零距離」超清自拍，並興奮發文大晒命：「就係咁 Lucky，追星成功。開心到手都震埋，兩位超 nice，痞子世一！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_62f7a22dfc1d6f6e-1008\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c86ed1cf-593b-4e6c-996e-4752b8b1bfde.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ITwAqYwa5b1790068016.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c86ed1cf-593b-4e6c-996e-4752b8b1bfde.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_62f7a22dfc1d6f6e-1009\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>此外，更有網民分享了周嘉洛、朱敏瀚及高海寧在首爾街頭跳舞的拍攝花絮。片中三人對著鏡頭 Chok 到爆，型格十足，互動更是默契滿分！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_62f7a22dfc1d6f6e-1010\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>片段與合照曝光後，隨即引來大批網民羨慕留言：「葡萄」、「我都想同嘉洛同朱仔影相」、「佢兩個好靚仔」、「好期待佢哋個節目呀！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_62f7a22dfc1d6f6e-1010\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"bd63137c-82a1-48b3-b51d-affd6b1978f0.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026yNjxTYcxnO1790068016.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"bd63137c-82a1-48b3-b51d-affd6b1978f0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T09:19:54.265084+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}